---
/* First Shares · ebook opt-in. Copy: clients/firstshares/funnels/ebook/COPY.md · Section map: clients/firstshares/DESIGN-PLAN.md */
import Layout from '../../../layouts/FunnelLayout.astro';
import Container from '../../../components/ui/Container.astro';
import OptInForm from '../../../components/funnel/OptInForm.astro';
import GraphPaper from '../../../components/clients/firstshares/GraphPaper.astro';
import CoachStory from '../../../components/clients/firstshares/CoachStory.astro';
import Deadline from '../../../components/clients/firstshares/Deadline.astro';
import Button from '../../../components/ui/Button.astro';
import ProcessLedger from '../../../components/clients/firstshares/ProcessLedger.astro';
import PhotoClose from '../../../components/clients/firstshares/PhotoClose.astro';
import FaqList from '../../../components/clients/firstshares/FaqList.astro';
import CompoundCurve from '../../../components/clients/firstshares/art/CompoundCurve.astro';
import Highlight from '../../../components/clients/firstshares/art/Highlight.astro';
import GuideCover from '../../../components/clients/firstshares/art/GuideCover.astro';
import { PHOTOS } from '../../../components/clients/firstshares/photos';
import { LEDGERS } from '../../../components/clients/firstshares/data';
const form = { client: 'firstshares', funnel: 'ebook', redirect: '/firstshares/ebook/thanks', magnet: 'first-1000-plan', buttonLabel: 'Send me the First $1,000 Plan', consent: 'Free PDF in your inbox in a minute. Five short emails from Richard. Unsubscribe in one click.' };
const inside = [
  { n: '5', unit: 'accounts', line: '401(k), Roth, traditional IRA, HSA, brokerage, compared on one page: which one first, and why.' },
  { n: '3', unit: 'fund types', line: 'The whole portfolio, plus the four numbers to check on any fund before you buy it.' },
  { n: '1', unit: 'rule', line: 'Automate before you optimise. Set it once on payday and stop checking the app.' },
  { n: '40', unit: 'minutes', line: 'Roughly how long the first account takes to open. The checklist is on page 8.' },
];
const pages = [
  ['2', 'The cost of waiting', 'Illustrated, with the assumption written next to it.'],
  ['3', 'The order', 'Match, Roth, brokerage, and when to break it.'],
  ['4', 'Five accounts on one page', 'Compared in plain English.'],
  ['5', 'The three fund types', 'And the four numbers that matter.'],
  ['6', 'The one rule', 'The automatic transfer, step by step.'],
  ['7', 'A bad year', 'What to do when it’s red. Mostly: nothing.'],
  ['8', 'The Saturday checklist', 'Print it. Tick it.'],
];
const faq = [
  { q: 'Isn’t this all free on YouTube?', a: 'Most of it, scattered across 30 hours that disagree with each other. The guide is one order on eight pages. Free too.' },
  { q: 'What if the market drops right after I start?', a: 'It will at some point; markets go down as well as up, and you can lose money. Page 7 is the plan for that. The short version: money you need in the next few years shouldn’t be invested at all, and the automatic transfer keeps buying either way.' },
  { q: 'What’s the catch?', a: 'After the guide, Richard will tell you about the paid course. That’s it. First Shares never sells funds, never takes commissions, and isn’t paid by any brokerage you choose.' },
  { q: 'Is this advice for my situation?', a: 'No. It’s education, the same for everyone. For personal advice, talk to a fee-only fiduciary adviser.' },
  { q: 'What happens after I enter my email?', a: 'The PDF lands in about a minute. Then five short emails over a week, one idea each. Unsubscribe in one click.' },
];
---
<Layout client="firstshares" funnel="ebook" step="optin" title="Where should your first $1,000 go? Free: The First $1,000 Plan" description="Not the best fund: the order. Which account first, which three fund types, and the one rule that does the rest. A free 8-page guide for late starters from a former Wall Street analyst.">
  <Deadline variant="bar" />

  <section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-bg pt-8 pb-14 sm:pt-12 sm:pb-20">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-5 text-center sm:px-8">
      <p class="mx-auto inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-pill border-2 border-fg bg-surface px-4 py-1.5 text-sm font-bold"><span class="size-2 rounded-pill bg-primary" aria-hidden="true"></span>Free guide · for late starters, 30–45</p>
      <h1 class="mx-auto mt-6 max-w-[18ch] font-display text-[clamp(2.75rem,1.4rem+4.2vw,4.75rem)] leading-[0.94] font-extrabold tracking-[-0.04em]">Where should your first $1,000 go? <Highlight>Here’s the order.</Highlight></h1>
      <p class="mx-auto mt-6 max-w-[52ch] text-lead text-fg-muted">Not the “best” fund. <strong class="text-fg">The order</strong>: which account first, which three fund types, and the one rule that does the rest. Eight pages from a former Wall Street analyst who now teaches it plainly.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="mx-auto mt-8 grid max-w-5xl items-center gap-10 px-5 sm:px-8 md:grid-cols-[minmax(0,4fr)_minmax(0,6fr)]">
      <div class="relative order-2 mx-auto w-[min(56vw,260px)] md:order-1 md:w-full md:max-w-[300px]">
        <GuideCover class="-rotate-3" />
        <p class="absolute -top-4 -right-4 grid size-20 rotate-12 place-items-center rounded-pill bg-accent text-center font-display text-sm leading-tight font-extrabold text-accent-fg shadow-pop">Free<br />PDF</p>
      </div>
      <div class="order-1 rounded-xl bg-surface p-6 shadow-pop sm:p-8 md:order-2">
        <p class="font-display text-2xl font-extrabold">Get the plan, free, in your inbox now</p>
        <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2 text-fg-muted">
          <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="font-bold text-primary" aria-hidden="true">✓</span>The order: match, Roth, brokerage</li>
          <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="font-bold text-primary" aria-hidden="true">✓</span>5 accounts compared on one page</li>
          <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="font-bold text-primary" aria-hidden="true">✓</span>The Saturday checklist: first account in about 40 minutes</li>
        </ul>
        <OptInForm {...form} class="mt-6 max-w-none" />
        <p class="mt-4 rounded-md bg-primary-soft px-4 py-3 text-sm"><strong>This month only:</strong> readers who download before the month ends also get a seat on Richard’s free live Q&amp;A on the 1st.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <ul class="mx-auto mt-12 flex max-w-5xl flex-wrap justify-center gap-x-10 gap-y-2 px-5 text-sm text-fg-muted sm:px-8">
      <li><strong class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-fg tabular-nums">11,400</strong> downloads</li>
      <li>By a <strong class="text-fg">19-year Wall Street analyst</strong></li>
      <li>“It took three Saturdays.” <strong class="text-fg">Denise R., 41, ICU nurse</strong></li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-bg py-16 sm:py-24">
    <Container size="wide">
      <h2 class="max-w-[20ch] text-h1 font-display font-extrabold">What’s in the eight pages</h2>
      <dl class="mt-10 grid grid-cols-2 gap-x-5 sm:gap-x-10 lg:grid-cols-4">
        {inside.map((it, i) => (
          <div class="border-t-2 border-fg py-6">
            <dt class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-x-2 font-display font-extrabold leading-none tracking-[-0.04em]">
              <span class:list={['text-[clamp(3.75rem,2.5rem+5vw,7.5rem)] tabular-nums', i === 0 ? 'text-primary' : 'text-fg']}>{it.n}</span>
              <span class="text-lg tracking-[-0.02em] text-fg-muted sm:text-2xl">{it.unit}</span>
            </dt>
            <dd class="mt-3 max-w-[30ch] text-sm text-fg-muted sm:text-base">{it.line}</dd>
          </div>
        ))}
      </dl>
    </Container>
  </section>

  <GraphPaper pad="lg">
    <Container size="wide" class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,4fr)_minmax(0,7fr)] lg:items-center">
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-h1 font-display font-extrabold text-balance">The cost of waiting is a real number.</h2>
        <p class="mt-6 max-w-[44ch] text-lead text-fg-muted">The same $500 a month, started at 35 instead of 45. Same person, same funds, same habit. The only difference is ten years.</p>
        <p class="mt-6 max-w-[44ch] text-lead font-semibold">Ten years ago was the best time to start. This month is the second best, and it’s the one you still have.</p>
      </div>
      <CompoundCurve class="rounded-xl bg-surface p-5 shadow-pop sm:p-8" />
    </Container>
    <div class="mt-12 flex justify-center px-5"><Button href="#get-the-plan" size="xl" data-cta="curve">Send me the First $1,000 Plan</Button></div>
  </GraphPaper>

  <section class="bg-surface-2 py-16 sm:py-24">
    <Container size="wide" class="grid items-center gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,4fr)_minmax(0,7fr)]">
      <GuideCover class="mx-auto w-[min(64vw,300px)] rotate-2 lg:w-full lg:max-w-[360px]" />
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-h1 font-display font-extrabold text-balance">Eight pages. Built to print and tick off.</h2>
        <ol class="mt-8 border-t border-border-strong">
          {pages.map(([n, t, b]) => (
            <li class="grid grid-cols-[3.25rem_1fr] items-baseline gap-4 border-b border-border py-4">
              <span class="font-display text-sm font-bold text-fg-muted">p.&nbsp;{n}</span>
              <span><span class="font-display text-xl font-bold">{t}</span> <span class="text-fg-muted">{b}</span></span>
            </li>
          ))}
        </ol>
      </div>
    </Container>
  </section>

  <CoachStory heading="Written by someone who spent 19 years inside Wall Street.">
    <p>I’m Richard Hale. For 19 years I was an equity analyst and fund-product manager on Wall Street. I watched the industry sell complicated, expensive products to people who needed three cheap funds and an automatic transfer.</p>
    <p>The First $1,000 Plan is what I wish every late starter got before anyone tried to sell them something. <strong>I don’t sell funds, I don’t take commissions and I don’t manage anyone’s money.</strong> I teach the order, and then you leave it alone.</p>
  </CoachStory>

  <section class="bg-surface-2 py-16 sm:py-24">
    <Container size="wide">
      <h2 class="max-w-[20ch] text-h1 font-display font-extrabold">Three people who started.</h2>
      <ProcessLedger class="mt-10" rows={LEDGERS} />
      <p class="mt-6 text-sm text-fg-muted">Stories describe actions, not account balances. Everyone’s situation is different.</p>
    </Container>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-bg py-16 sm:py-24">
    <Container size="wide"><FaqList items={faq} /></Container>
  </section>

  <PhotoClose src={PHOTOS.saturday} alt="A woman with coffee and a laptop in a bright kitchen" focus="35% 40%">
    <h2 class="font-display text-display font-extrabold">Your first account. <span class="text-accent">This Saturday.</span></h2>
    <p class="mt-6 text-lead opacity-90">Free PDF, eight pages: the order, the accounts, the three fund types and the checklist.</p>
    <div id="get-the-plan" class="mt-8 scroll-mt-24 rounded-xl bg-surface p-5 text-fg sm:p-6"><OptInForm {...form} inline class="max-w-none" /></div>
  </PhotoClose>
</Layout>
